'''Hoshi Grandmarnier''' is a  [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] implemented in [[Version 3.4 Update|Version 3.4]] and was created by a collaboration event between [[Kishidan Collaboration Event|Battle Cats and Kishidan]]. He could be unlocked by using the [[Serial Codes|serial code]] from Kishidan's CD (幸せにしかしねーから), which is no longer possible due to the removal of serial codes.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 165
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Hoshi Grandmarnier
|name2 = Ranma & Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Ranma & Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Hoshi is virtually a weaker [[Kung Fu Cat (Special Cat)|Kung Fu Cat]] on all fronts. Though Hoshi has decent stats, his recharge time massively drags down his usage below most other midrangers, including the aforementioned Kung Fu as well as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon Cat]] and [[Actress Cat (Special Cat)|Actress Cat]]. Even [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]]'s superior stats and useful tankiness put Hoshi's usability in [[Empire of Cats]] into question, the only place Hoshi could even hypothetically be useful.

{{Job|Classification = Midranger}}

